OL,3,ADUP leader says Sinn Fein presence at
OL,4,AOrange Order protest 'unlawful' as
OL,5,Amarch delayed for hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson has
OL,8,Fcriticised her party's participation in
OL,9,Fthe protest, telling a news conference
OL,10,Fthat O'Neill and other Sinn Fein
OL,11,Fpoliticians at the protest are
OL,12,F"lawmakers acting as lawbreakers"
OL,14,FPolice are calling for protesters to
OL,15,Fdisperse - the march will go ahead when
OL,16,Fthe road is clear, the Orange Order
OL,17,Fsays. A "sterile zone" is in place to
OL,18,Fkeep the two sides apart
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
